    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835550/extras/aed80cfe6b1c7995384c4705da0d6ce5.poster.avif?t=1752644995\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835550/extras/aed80cfe6b1c7995384c4705da0d6ce5.webm?t=1752644995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835550/extras/aed80cfe6b1c7995384c4705da0d6ce5.mp4?t=1752644995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buzzopolis: Hive Incremental</strong> is an incremental roguelite colony sim in pixel art style.<br> <strong>Build \u2192 Optimize \u2192 Explode \u2192 Repeat</strong><br> Build a thriving hive, upgrade your colony, and experiment with resources and strategies. But beware: mutations accumulate, cells become infected, and eventually, it's easier to blow it all up. Activate the Phoenix Protocol, keep your bonuses, and start a new, stronger cycle.<br> Progress, chaos, and a bit of humor \u2014 all in one hive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong><br> \u2699\ufe0f <strong>Incremental Gameplay</strong> \u2014 Clear growth loops, prestige, and constant development in the spirit of top idle games.<br> \ud83d\udd04 <strong>Roguelite Loop</strong> \u2014 Progress reset retains upgrades, unlocking new strategies and builds.<br> \ud83e\udde0 <strong>Flexible Management</strong> \u2014 Choose which cells to build, what to collect, where to assign bees, and what to research.<br> \ud83e\uddea <strong>Experiments &amp; Mutations</strong> \u2014 Bees mutate, infected cells can be healed or destroyed. Sometimes destruction is the best path forward.<br> \ud83d\udc1d <strong>Stylized Pixel World</strong> \u2014 Bright minimalism, cute animations, and a pinch of humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buzzopolis is a fun experiment where every decision leads to new paths, and every mistake is a chance to do better.<br> \ud83d\udc9c A big hive starts with one click! Add Buzzopolis to your wishlist \u2014 let the bees know you're with us!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835550/extras/d90d5fd37b183b1b55f442e1d0fe29c7.poster.avif?t=1752644995\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835550/extras/d90d5fd37b183b1b55f442e1d0fe29c7.webm?t=1752644995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835550/extras/d90d5fd37b183b1b55f442e1d0fe29c7.mp4?t=1752644995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835550/extras/aed80cfe6b1c7995384c4705da0d6ce5.poster.avif?t=1752644995\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835550/extras/aed80cfe6b1c7995384c4705da0d6ce5.webm?t=1752644995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835550/extras/aed80cfe6b1c7995384c4705da0d6ce5.mp4?t=1752644995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buzzopolis: Hive Incremental</strong> is an incremental roguelite colony sim in pixel art style.<br> <strong>Build \u2192 Optimize \u2192 Explode \u2192 Repeat</strong><br> Build a thriving hive, upgrade your colony, and experiment with resources and strategies. But beware: mutations accumulate, cells become infected, and eventually, it's easier to blow it all up. Activate the Phoenix Protocol, keep your bonuses, and start a new, stronger cycle.<br> Progress, chaos, and a bit of humor \u2014 all in one hive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong><br> \u2699\ufe0f <strong>Incremental Gameplay</strong> \u2014 Clear growth loops, prestige, and constant development in the spirit of top idle games.<br> \ud83d\udd04 <strong>Roguelite Loop</strong> \u2014 Progress reset retains upgrades, unlocking new strategies and builds.<br> \ud83e\udde0 <strong>Flexible Management</strong> \u2014 Choose which cells to build, what to collect, where to assign bees, and what to research.<br> \ud83e\uddea <strong>Experiments &amp; Mutations</strong> \u2014 Bees mutate, infected cells can be healed or destroyed. Sometimes destruction is the best path forward.<br> \ud83d\udc1d <strong>Stylized Pixel World</strong> \u2014 Bright minimalism, cute animations, and a pinch of humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buzzopolis is a fun experiment where every decision leads to new paths, and every mistake is a chance to do better.<br> \ud83d\udc9c A big hive starts with one click! Add Buzzopolis to your wishlist \u2014 let the bees know you're with us!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835550/extras/d90d5fd37b183b1b55f442e1d0fe29c7.poster.avif?t=1752644995\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835550/extras/d90d5fd37b183b1b55f442e1d0fe29c7.webm?t=1752644995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835550/extras/d90d5fd37b183b1b55f442e1d0fe29c7.mp4?t=1752644995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "An incremental roguelite colony sim about bees, mutations, and controlled chaos. Experiment with management, crafting, research, and upgrades. When mutations spiral out of control \u2014 collapse the hive, keep progress, and start fresh. Every run unlocks new strategies and a buzz of unpredictable fun.",
